Additional notice for this project:

This tool creates partitions, applies Windows images and modifies the boot
configuration store. It requires administrator privileges and it is designed
to ADD boot entries, never to modify or remove existing ones. Even so: keep a
backup of anything you cannot afford to lose, and read docs/USER-GUIDE.md
before running it on a machine that matters.
